                                "text": "A zero or partical burn, not complicated by guidance malfunction, which results in a velocity of more than 7550 ft/sec at periselene places the prime transport vehicle (PTV) on a hyperbolic escape trajectory out of the lunar sphere of influence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fd63b99-cfb5-4569-ab70-16711199be2f",
                                "sense_id": "ca36f16b-c8a1-3546-b0c9-16e44ccdf64a",
                                "text": "The lunar module shifted into an elliptic orbit with a periselene altitude of 14.3 km ± 200 m and an aposelene altitude of 113.2 km. At periselene tests of the radar altimeter, which ensures the landing of the lunar module on the Moon's surface, were carried out."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5b5d59f-def0-4bfe-a3a6-fc5efb220a97",
                                "sense_id": "ca36f16b-c8a1-3546-b0c9-16e44ccdf64a",
                                "text": "These are a periselene altitude reduction and an inclination increase."
